%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
/s { length r } def
/e { stopped b } def
{ 1 2 3 stop 4 } stopped b clear
{ 5 } stopped b r
{ undefinedthing } stopped b
{ { stop } stopped b 7 r } stopped b
{ (x) 1 add } stopped b $error /errorname get length r $error /command get length r
5 stopped b r
